{"id":"297ec118e51b2051","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-ground-decomposition.md","title":"Ground Decomposition Theorem","display":"thm-ground-decomposition — Ground Decomposition Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ground-decomposition","aliases":["58-thm-ground-decomposition"],"display":"thm-ground-decomposition — Ground Decomposition Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ground-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ground-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-decomposition — Ground Decomposition Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\">\\(V,W\\)</span> (class-model parameters).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,G\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,G\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P\\in W\">\\(P,\\leq_P\\in W\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\)</span> are the predicates used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,G\\;\\bigl(\nP,\\leq_P\\in W\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,W,\\leq_P)\\land\nV=W[G]\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,G\\;\\bigl(\nP,\\leq_P\\in W\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,W,\\leq_P)\\land\nV=W[G]\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The implication only unpacks the forcing-witness conjunct of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\)</span>; it does not assert that every universe has a nontrivial proper ground.</li>\n<li>The Ground Axiom instead asserts that no proper inner model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> is a ground of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; it is not the displayed implication.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S$, $\\mathrm{Poset}$, and $\\mathrm{Generic}_S$ are the predicates used by [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,W","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground-decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,G\\;\\bigl(\nP,\\leq_P\\in W\\land\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,W,\\leq_P)\\land\nV=W[G]\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1090,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-ground-decomposition.md|58-thm-ground-decomposition]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e"]}